  "id": "work-psychology",
  "term": "work psychology",
  "definition": "Work psychology is an area of psychology that brings together understanding of individual people and how they relate to the organizational environment at work. In this context, it helps explain behavior in workplaces by linking individuality with the wider culture and setting of the organization.",
